/ActualText ( Creatives - A significant majority of Creative respondents in Baltimore \(77%\) definitely plan to continue working in the music industry over the next three years, with an additional 15% either probably or possibly continuing. However, their commitment to staying in Baltimore is lower, with 45% definitely planning to remain in the city and 31% either probably or possibly staying. A notable 21% are uncertain or considering leaving Baltimore.)
