/ActualText (Work Outside Music - A large portion of respondents \(47%\) work outside the music industry to supplement their income, with 81% of these individuals relying on their outside job as their primary source of income. This highlights the financial challenges faced by Baltimore music professionals, where external employment is often necessary to achieve financial stability.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
