/P 1062 0 R
/ActualText (Creative Performance Frequency & Pay - Performance frequency among Baltimore respondents varies widely. A significant 28% do not perform any local paid shows per month, while 23% perform one show per month. The average pay per local performance is $309, whereas touring performances yield a slightly higher average of $372 per gig. For touring, 60% of respondents do not perform any shows per month, with only 2% performing 10 or more shows. This data underscores the limited performance opportunities and income potential from local and touring shows.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [14]
